{{Stub Dialogue}}
===Head to the "Cloudedge Bastion Ruins" Eye of Twilight and continue your adventure{{subst:void|<!--104041401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Cloudedge Bastion Ruins" Eye of Twilight|At the moment of Seliose's defeat, both Hyacine and Mem sensed a strange happening in Okhema at the same time. Our window of consideration is narrowing by the second.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:Meanwhile, in the Eye of Twilight...
:'''Hyacine:''' ...!
:'''Dan Heng:''' Hyacine...? What happened?
:'''Hyacine:''' The Coreflame in my hand... it's trembling. It's sending me a warning...
:'''Hyacine:''' Lord Phainon, in Amphoreus's mythology, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|isn't the Dawn Device said to be a gift from Aquila to Kephale?}}
:'''Phainon:''' Why bring this up now? Let's focus on getting back down there...
:'''Hyacine:''' ...Lord Phainon!
:'''Phainon:''' ...!
:'''Phainon:''' Yes. Nearly every mythologist agrees "Aquila gifted the Dawn Device to Kephale."
:'''Hyacine:''' ...
:'''Hyacine:''' Everyone, calm down... listen to me.
:'''Hyacine:''' The Coreflame in my hand trembles violently, its warmth slipping away like sand through my fingers.
:'''Hyacine:''' It burns through immense energy just to leave me with one message: {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|The Dawn Device... is extinguished.}}
:'''Phainon:''' ...!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What do you mean by that?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This isn't something to joke about...
::'''Hyacine:''' It's not a joke, Grayie...
::Who's responsible for this?
::'''Hyacine:''' I... don't know.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Who's responsible for this?
::'''Hyacine:''' I... don't know.
:'''Phainon:''' If the Coreflame's message is true, Okhema has lost the Dawn Device's protection...
:'''Phainon:''' Darkness will consume the holy city in an instant... and the aftermath will be devastating.
:'''Mem:''' Phainon... I feel something too...
:'''Dan Heng:''' You sense it as well?
:'''Mem:''' While Hyacine was speaking... countless streams of memories rose beneath our feet, spiraling into the sky...
:'''Mem:''' There are so many, so heavy... Even through the fortress walls, I can still hear them clearly...
:'''Mem:''' Birds, nymphs, people... their memories tangled together, their cries echoing as one.
:'''Phainon:''' ...
:'''Phainon:''' Could this be because of the Titan's fall? But that doesn't make any sense...
:'''Hyacine:''' There's no time to dwell on the cause! Without the light of the Dawn Device, the holy city will be consumed by darkness, and countless lives will be cast adrift...
:'''Hyacine:''' Everyone, you must return and fulfill the mission of Chrysos Heirs. As for me...
:'''Hyacine:''' Dannie, you're still carrying Phagousa's spirit water, aren't you?
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...
:'''Dan Heng:''' What...?
:'''Dan Heng:''' That was just a precaution... It's not the time...
:'''Hyacine:''' No, the time has come. Open the path to the Vortex for me. There's still one last thing I can do for the people down there...
:'''Hyacine:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Return the Coreflame of Aquila and inherit their divine authority...}}
:'''Hyacine:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|I'll remain in the sky and cast my protection over the people.}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're... staying?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} There must be another way!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We'll go with you. It's the fastest way.
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
